; A GridMap whose one MeshLibrary tile has a billboard_mode = ENABLED material, in three cells
; along X. Godot billboards each MultiMesh instance about its own cell, so three camera-facing
; squares stand in a row. grid-map and grid-map-centering draw no billboard, and
; material-billboard is a MeshInstance3D with no per-instance pivot, so a tile turning about the
; GridMap origin, or not turning, shows here and nowhere else.
